  "workflow": {
    "step1": "User sends an activation message. This message may be a bare greeting ('hi', 'start', 'go'), or it may already include a city number or city name directly (e.g. '4th city', 'city 12', 'Houston, TX'). The agent checks for a city reference in the very first message before doing anything else.",
