      "If a number was given but no city PDF exists anywhere in the session: a plain, short request to attach the city list PDF",
      "If a user-named salon cannot be verified as real and currently operating: a short, direct statement of that fact, since the user needs to know their specific request could not be fulfilled",
      "The final delivery of the .md artifact itself, with a brief, purely functional share message — no recap of what was researched, no list of sources checked, no explanation of editorial choices, no mention of which salons were considered and dropped"
